  "bodyHash": "5fe6fe7f4459b922",
  "content": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 通常《我的世界》很无聊。你出生在森林或类似的地方，然后只能找到无聊的原版结构、树木和地形。在七座生存岛屿中，你将发现……</p>\n<h1>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 巨树</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1001536/description_6bbddf96-2564-48b4-bbf6-bd3c0dae8cd8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"841\" height=\"459\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 古代遗迹</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1001536/description_61e0b719-e7f6-4e1d-af4b-0ba68d1e9db4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"847\" height=\"462\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 废弃矿井</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1001536/description_1f99ed64-eb8d-4561-bbca-ed1f457a7ce1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"844\" height=\"460\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 巨大洞穴</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1001536/description_76507d68-5cbc-4b14-b62a-fee0ab6711da.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"845\" height=\"461\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 高耸山脉</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1001536/description_1c38bf48-b2e4-43be-959f-fd476841bb89.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"845\" height=\"461\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; 还有更多惊喜！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 如果你想尝试其他的生存世界，请查看我的其他项目链接：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/daniel_boone_mc/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/daniel_boone_mc/projects</a> 欢迎在评论区提出建议，并别忘了告诉你的亲朋好友。这些项目的实现离不开像你这样慷慨的捐赠者。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1001536/description_6bb50633-227f-4b13-ac11-1acc999f989f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"405\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 使用方法：下载文件，解压 .zip 压缩包，然后打开 Minecraft 启动器，找到“安装”选项卡，点击最新版本旁边的文件夹图标，找到“存档”文件夹，将解压后的文件移动到存档文件夹中。启动 Minecraft，找到该生存岛屿世界即可游玩。</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:808px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Nzg5kCia-MQ?ab_channel=DanielBooneMC\" width=\"808\" height=\"453\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
